                                "sense_id": "7321e58c-ce81-3ba3-abe6-ab95a7671a79",
                                "text": "Bogle the diplomat tried to hide the sound of his gagging as he vommed the night away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e5029c1-de3a-4f68-a358-ec17d270ccbf",
                                "sense_id": "7321e58c-ce81-3ba3-abe6-ab95a7671a79",
                                "text": "Then the waft of puke and stale bourbon reaches my nostrils and I get that shorp^([sic]) taste in my mouth that you get when you know you're going to vom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1f8bb44-88c6-4ec1-b85b-90938000285b",
                                "sense_id": "7321e58c-ce81-3ba3-abe6-ab95a7671a79",
                                "text": "“Okay, boss. Boss. You're short-circuiting. We wrote great jokes. Stay the course.” “Absolutely. Yeah, you're right. Um... yeah. I'm gonna make a pit stop at the bathroom for a quick vom. And then, yeah, I'll be right back.” “That's my girl!”"
